WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:04.204
- Wet roll, ketchup,
double dog. [Burping]

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.107
Ignore the mountain of bread.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:12.812
Hello, everyone.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.983
I am Jack Settleman, two-time
champion of the Punishment League,

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.353
but unfortunately, in
Week 4, I am the loser.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.322
Russell Wilson—he played well.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:26.626
Everyone wanted Derrick Henry
against the Jets. Davante Adams—Mr.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.762
Touchdown, every single week last year.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:30.930
So, I pay up for Davante Adams.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.334
And who scores two touchdowns?
Randall freaking Cobb.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:38.071
But, what pains me even
more than that, I spent

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.173
$49,900.

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.908
I was $100 away

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:45.779
from upgrading Adams to
Tyreek Hill, and I didn't do it.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:51.284
And now, I have to attempt
to eat 20 hot dogs in 20 minutes.

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.986
It's time to punish myself.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.157
Oh, no.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.493
The bread is going to be the
hardest part. Ah, that’s disgusting.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.663
One down. So, Joey Chestnut.

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:07.333
eats 74 of these in 10 minutes.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.171
And I like hot dogs.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:16.009
We’re two down. I’m like, two
minutes in. I’m on pace.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.712
I didn’t prep for the loneliness
that this will be. No

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.515
one is talking to me. I'm
essentially talking myself.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:27.287
All right—three down.
It’s kinda easy.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:33.059
What my mom always told me,
though: “Never fill up on bread.”

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.428
I kinda wanna do a double
glizzy shot here.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.731
I'm not having fun.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:42.469
I do have this in case of
emergency. I’ve done

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.974
about four-and-a-half, so far.
This is for you, Randall Cobb.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.546
I didn’t like that.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.815
Oh, let’s go, second wind.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.419
The double glizzy has
been the best strategy.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:03.756
I know all people, on the app
and on Instagram, will be like,

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.291
“Oh, you didn’t finish any bread.”

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.194
You finish the bread, then.
You do the challenge, all right?

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.163
I'm gonna go with some ketchup.

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:12.599
I know it's probably not strategic, but…
I don't even like ketchup that much.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.539
I don't even like ketchup that much.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.812
The pile of hot dogs I have
to eat is not shrinking.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.380
This is for you,

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.716
Will Dissly. Two catches?

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:35.155
Is there a way to make yourself burp?
Lemme look that up.

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:45.899
There we go. Yeah, I knew
that wasn't gonna go well.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:50.436
Ten minutes down. A burp!

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:58.311
Five, eight, 10. I’ve only done
six hot dogs? What the heck?

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:02.749
[Phone ringing]
The Feds are on line one.

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:05.018
They said you can't eat
this many hot dogs.

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:08.688
So, if I finish this bite,
I’ll have seven down.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:11.958
So, like, 11 minutes,
which is a good pace. I'm

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:16.930
proud of that pace. [Burping]
Oh, c’mon c’mon. [Burping]

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.866
Is anything else coming out
with that burp besides that?

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:26.539
C’mon, big burp.
[Burping] Mm.

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.176
Ugh, I can't even do it.

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.412
We're going back to
the double dog strat.

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:35.148
It’s the only way to do it.

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:37.650
Oh, now I’m just eating mustard.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:48.962
This is one of the most vile
things I’ve ever experienced.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.604
I really feel like I’m going to throw up
pretty soon, so...that’s exciting.

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:01.674
This is what I got left of the eighth one.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.277
I can’t even get a whole thing down.

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:09.449
I think I might throw in the white towel soon.
This is No. 8. Shout out to Lamar Jackson,

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:10.183
He's No. 8,

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:11.384
he's the baby GOAT.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:14.821
I'm the baby GOAT of eating hot dogs.

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:16.756
Eight hot dogs, 20 minutes.

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.458
You can't beat that.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.494
No one watching this can beat that score.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:26.332
Next Sunday, I will win the Punishment
League, because I never, ever,

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.434
am going through something
like this ever again.

